# Push-staging scaffolding must never be tracked.
# Added by the repo clone-bloat audit, 2026-07-22
# (docs/handoffs/repo-clone-bloat-audit-2026-07.md). scripts/_rule27_push_staging/
# held a base64-chunked tar.gz of oversized source files staged for a push that
# git push (413) / a single push_files call could not carry; the five staged
# files were assembled onto main long ago, so the chunks are orphaned clutter.
# Ignore the whole convention so it can never recur.
_rule27_push_staging/
*_push_staging/
